Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.36,0:00:06.90,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She's into the quarterfinals in Tokyo at the first time of asking.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N首次出战东京 她就打进了{\fs78}8{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.25,0:00:10.78,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}先丢一盘 伊埃拉却连赢了最后{\fs78}9{\fs68}局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.78,0:00:13.51,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.51,0:00:16.97,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}她在东京逆转吉布森 晋级八强
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.65,0:00:20.18,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}东京{\fs78}500{\fs68}赛第二轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.18,0:00:22.08,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}伊埃拉对阵吉布森
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.08,0:00:23.59,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}首盘{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}落后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.59,0:00:25.31,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}她回破追到{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.31,0:00:27.43,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}却再次丢掉发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.43,0:00:30.36,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}盘末这一分 更让人意外
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.36,0:00:46.66,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}No way!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N不会吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.20,0:00:48.60,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}First set.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N第一盘结束
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.80,0:00:50.20,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}How is your luck?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这运气 真是没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.96,0:00:54.30,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Well, it's not in for Alexandra Eala.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N伊埃拉没有得到幸运眷顾
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.35,0:00:57.06,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's definitely in for Talia Gibson.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N吉布森却得到了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.06,0:01:01.86,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a way to claim the opener.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她就这样拿下了首盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.33,0:01:04.60,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}丢掉首盘后 伊埃拉先破发
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.60,0:01:06.75,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}再稳住自己的发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.75,0:01:08.77,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}吉布森一发进球后的得分率
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.77,0:01:13.20,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}从首盘{\fs78}78{\fs68}% 降到第二盘{\fs78}60{\fs68}%
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.83,0:01:16.31,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}第二盘{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}之后
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.31,0:01:17.79,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}伊埃拉连赢{\fs78}3{\fs68}局
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.79,0:01:19.87,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}把比赛拖进决胜盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.87,0:01:22.54,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}随后{\fs78}6{\fs68}局 她全部拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.54,0:01:26.18,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}跨盘连赢{\fs78}9{\fs68}局 逆转就在眼前
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.74,0:01:39.28,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She's into the quarterfinals in Tokyo at the first time of asking.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N首次出战东京 她就打进了{\fs78}8{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.42,0:01:43.18,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's her sixth of the year.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这是她今年第六次晋级{\fs78}8{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.18,0:01:46.68,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A stunning year for Alexandra Eala.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N伊埃拉度过了一个出色的赛季
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.82,0:01:50.36,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Gets better and better on debut in Tokyo.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N首次出战东京 她越打越好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.47,0:01:55.09,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Had to do it the long way round today,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N今天她走了一条艰难的路
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.09,0:02:01.81,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And lost that opening set on a really rough net cord.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N首盘还输在一次无奈的擦网上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.53,0:02:04.31,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}But how good was the fightback?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但这场反击多么出色！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.97,0:02:08.61,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A performance of real tenacity.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她展现了真正的韧性
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.80,0:02:10.21,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fs78}9{\fs68}个直接发球得分
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.21,0:02:12.57,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fs78}9{\fs68}次破发机会兑现{\fs78}6{\fs68}次
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.57,0:02:13.47,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}决胜盘
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.47,0:02:16.98,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}吉布森一发进球后{\fs78}12{\fs68}分只拿四分
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.98,0:02:18.79,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}伊埃拉把压力留给对手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.79,0:02:21.09,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}也把胜利留给了自己
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.80,0:02:24.20,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}从盘末的无奈
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.20,0:02:26.91,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}到赛后的挥手致意 这场逆转
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.91,0:02:29.38,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}伊埃拉没有把遗憾留到最后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.38,0:02:32.59,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}下一轮 她还能继续向前吗？
